abstract: >
  Real evaluation outputs from AIGAP's AI Design Reviewer and Risk
  Classifier pipeline, covering four case studies spanning the Low
  Risk to Critical Risk assurance spectrum, and a five-round
  resubmission-convergence experiment documenting an evidentiary
  regress phenomenon in LLM-assisted compliance evaluation.
